{"title": "Legendary Action: Beguiling Rebuke", "pageid": 30383, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Beguiling_Rebuke", "categories": ["Honour mode", "Bugs", "Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"bg3wiki-honour-content-notice\" class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, #443E20, #232323); border-radius:10px; max-width: 630px; padding: 5px; width: auto; padding: 4px 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/33px-Honour_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/44px-Honour_Icon.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> This page is about content exclusive to <a href=\"/wiki/Honour_mode\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honour mode\">Honour mode</a>.</div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f4/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control.webp/300px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control.webp, /w/images/f/f4/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f4/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control.webp/300px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f4/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Legendary Action: Beguiling Rebuke</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Passive_feature\" title=\"Passive feature\">passive feature</a> available to <a href=\"/wiki/Raphael\" title=\"Raphael\">Raphael</a> while he is <em>not</em> in his <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fiendish_Ascension\" title=\"Fiendish Ascension\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/21/Fiendish_Ascension_Icon.webp/25px-Fiendish_Ascension_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/21/Fiendish_Ascension_Icon.webp/38px-Fiendish_Ascension_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/21/Fiendish_Ascension_Icon.webp/50px-Fiendish_Ascension_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fiendish Ascension\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/21/Fiendish_Ascension_Icon.webp/25px-Fiendish_Ascension_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/21/Fiendish_Ascension_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fiendish_Ascension\" title=\"Fiendish Ascension\">Fiendish Ascension</a> form. It lets him expend a legendary action to use <a href=\"/wiki/Beguiling_Rebuke\" title=\"Beguiling Rebuke\">Beguiling Rebuke</a>, after he or his allies are attacked.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Beguiled_(Condition)\" title=\"Beguiled (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Beguile\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Beguiled_(Condition)\" title=\"Beguiled (Condition)\">Beguile</a> your attacker and its nearby allies, possibly preventing them from attacking you again. \n</p><p>Cambions ascended by this cascade deal Hellfire damage, which ignores <a href=\"/wiki/Resistance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Resistance\">Resistance</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Immunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Immunity\">Immunity</a> to Fire damage.<sup><i>[<a class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\" href=\"#Bugs\">See: Bugs</a>]</i></sup>\n</p><p><span style=\"color: white;\">Legendary Actions restore at the start of each round.</span>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Legendary_Action:_Beguiling_Rebuke\"> Condition: Legendary Action: Beguiling Rebuke </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Beguiling_Rebuke_(Condition)\" title=\"Legendary Action: Beguiling Rebuke (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Legendary Action: Beguiling Rebuke\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Beguiling_Rebuke_(Condition)\" title=\"Legendary Action: Beguiling Rebuke (Condition)\">Legendary Action: Beguiling Rebuke</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Raphael can spend a Legendary Action to immediately <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Beguiling_Rebuke\" title=\"Beguiling Rebuke\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp/38px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp/50px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Beguile\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a3/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Beguiling_Rebuke\" title=\"Beguiling Rebuke\">Beguile</a> a hostile creature and its allies after being attacked.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Raphael\" title=\"Raphael\">Raphael</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Raphael can spend a Legendary Action to immediately <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Beguiling_Rebuke\" title=\"Beguiling Rebuke\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp/38px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp/50px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Beguile\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a3/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Beguiling_Rebuke\" title=\"Beguiling Rebuke\">Beguile</a> a hostile creature and its allies after being attacked.</li>\n<li>Raphael may use this Legendary Action as many times per round as there are <a href=\"/wiki/Pillar_of_Souls\" title=\"Pillar of Souls\">Soul Pillars</a> standing at the start of the round.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Beguiled_(Condition)\" title=\"Beguiled (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Beguiled\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Beguiled_(Condition)\" title=\"Beguiled (Condition)\">Beguiled</a> lacks the proper <a href=\"/wiki/Charmed_(status_group)\" title=\"Charmed (status group)\">Charmed status group</a>, and as such will not be removed or prevented by typical means.</li>\n<li>The extra description in this passive appears to be misplaced, as it has no relevance in this case.</li></ul>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202504\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.050 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1794/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 18301/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8805/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 24/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 124/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 767691/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   48.684      1 -total\n 99.26%   48.323      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n 32.94%   16.035      1 Template:PageSeo\n 32.34%   15.745      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 31.78%   15.470      5 Template:Icon_link\n 30.51%   14.853      